					<div class="marquee">
<div class="marquee-content">
Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Education has been renamed Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Engineering (HCM-UTE) under Decision No. 2809/QĐ-TTg issued by the Prime Minister. Smart governnance &amp; Empowering the HCM-UTE brand.
</div>
</div>
