				</div></div><div id='ctl05_portlet_b087f47f-14c8-4787-bdf0-5b15dda0231e' style="height:200px;float:left"><div>
					<table cellspacing="1" style="left: -7.85714px; width: 637.571px; height: 224.714px; top: -3.28571px;">
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 200px;">
            <p style="margin-left: 40px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><strong><span style="font-size: 11px; color: #0c0c0c;"><a href="https://hcmute.edu.vn/ArticleId/a23e271c-1dd9-44ab-b13b-c586759272f5/hcm-ute-successfully-hosts-gtsd-2026-advancing-green-technology-and-sustainable-development">HCM-UTE Successfully Hosts GTSD 2026, Advancing Green Technology and Sustainable Development</a></span></strong></span></p>
            <p style="margin-left: 40px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 9px; font-family: Arial;">On July 30&ndash;31, 2026, Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Engineering (HCM-UTE, formerly Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Education) successfully hosted The 8th International Conference on Green Technology and Sustainable Development (GTSD 2026).</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 200px;">
            <p style="margin-left: 40px; text-align: left;"><span style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; font-size: 11px; font-family: Arial; color: #0070c0;"><strong style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; color: #000000;"><a href="https://en.hcmute.edu.vn/ArticleId/ecb03803-0d56-4cb6-ab71-0daeb0153086/hcm-ute-signed-mou-with-the-vnu-hcm-dormitory-and-urban-area-management-center-to-strengthen-student-support">HCM-UTE Signed MOU with the VNU-HCM Dormitory and Urban Area Management Center to Strengthen Student Support</a><a href="https://en.hcmute.edu.vn/ArticleId/8adbf1fd-971b-4dc1-b44d-4c090a10c80c/hcmute-celebrated-inauguration-ceremony-of-the-creative-and-startup-zone-beehive">
            </a></span></strong></span></p>
            <p style="margin-left: 40px; text-align: left;"><span style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; font-size: 9px; text-align: justify; font-family: Arial;">On the morning of August 13, 2026, Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Engineering (HCM-UTE, formerly Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Education) held a signing ceremony for a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) and an exchange session on experience in space leasing and utilization with the Dormitory and Urban Area Management Center of Vietnam National University Ho Chi Minh City (VNU-HCM).</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
            <p style="margin-left: 40px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 11px; font-family: Arial;"><strong><span style="color: #000000;"><a href="https://en.hcmute.edu.vn/ArticleId/2822c78b-84db-40b0-9c1a-e8fb92c94f4d/hcm-ute-mahasarakham-university-thailand-academic-exchange-program-concludes-with-research-for-sustainable-development">HCM-UTE &ndash; Mahasarakham University (Thailand) Academic Exchange Program Concludes with Research for Sustainable Development</a></span></strong></span></p>
            <p style="margin-left: 40px; text-align: left;"><span style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 9px; font-family: Arial;">As part of the international cooperation program between Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Engineering (HCM-UTE, formerly Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Education) and Mahasarakham University (MSU), Thailand, the Faculty of Foreign Languages at HCM-UTE, in collaboration with several academic faculties, organized an academic exchange program for 30 students from Mahasarakham University from July 6&ndash;9, 2026.</span></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<br />

				</div></div><div id='ctl05_portlet_624b95b9-e6d5-4a4a-9b23-24b827f67b14' style="width:670px;height:40px;float:left"><div>
					<a href="https://en.hcmute.edu.vn/TopicId/799f785e-fb30-47f8-9902-4bcdec6ec7a4/alumni-events"><img alt="" src="/Resources/Images/SubDomain/HomePage/Nut/Nam%202024/4.ALUMNI%20EVENTS%20.jpg" style="width: 190px; height: 40px; margin-left: 100px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px;" /></a><a href="https://hcmute.edu.vn/TopicId/57ec372e-6b80-4c7d-aade-84f0fa3d62d5"><img alt="" src="/Resources/Images/SubDomain/HomePage/Nut/Nam%202024/5.CURRENT%20AND%20FORMER%20STAFF%20AND%20LECTURERS%20.jpg" style="width: 190px; height: 37px; margin-left: 120px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px;" /></a>

