				</div></div><div id='ctl05_portlet_13271e4a-df9d-4e82-b79b-1beee8ee1f50' style="width:670px;height:150px;float:left"><div>
					<table cellspacing="1" style="left: -29px; width: 650.8px; height: 237.8px; top: -3.28571px;">
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 200px;">
            <p style="text-align: left; margin-left: 40px;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><strong><span style="font-size: 11px; color: #0c0c0c;"><a href="https://en.hcmute.edu.vn/ArticleId/6e176546-83e3-4510-bd2d-c8c6918f47a5/hcmute-alumni-sports-festival-2025-a-gathering-of-sportsmanship-and-connection-with-hcmute">HCMUTE Alumni Sports Festival 2025: A Gathering of Sportsmanship and Connection with HCMUTE</a></span></strong></span></p>
            <p style="text-align: left; margin-left: 40px;"><span style="font-size: 9px; font-family: Arial;">
            With the desire to create a healthy and meaningful sports playground while strengthening the bonds among generations of alumni, faculty, and businesses, on September 21, 2025, the Alumni Association of Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Education (HCMUTE) organized the 2025 Alumni Sports Festival, attracting the enthusiastic participation of nearly 200 athletes from various units, enterprises, and alumni groups.</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 200px;">
            <p style="margin-left: 40px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: #0070c0;"><strong style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; color: #000000;"><a href="https://en.hcmute.edu.vn/ArticleId/11eca2f7-9bcb-4cdf-bc6a-3af21fd90f69/official-launch-of-the-accreditation-survey-for-eight-academic-programs-at-hcmute"></a><a href="https://en.hcmute.edu.vn/ArticleId/0da1fd27-ca72-4475-9323-8f45ea68af3a/hcmute-trade-union-brought-a-loving-mid-autumn-festival-to-the-children-of-staff-and-employees">HCMUTE Trade Union Brought a Loving Mid-Autumn Festival to the Children of Staff and Employees</a></span></strong></span><a href="https://hcmute.edu.vn/?ArticleId=99fbd293-b297-49a5-89e8-48e60b48cd2d" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-align: justify; font-size: x-small;"><span style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; color: #0070c0;"><br style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px;" />
            </span></a><span style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 9px;">In harmony with the joyful spirit of the Mid-Autumn Festival, on the evening of October 3, 2025 (the 12th day of the 8th lunar month), the Trade Union of Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Education (HCMUTE) organized the &ldquo;Mid-Autumn Festival Night 2025&rdquo; program for the children of the university&rsquo;s staff and employees.</span></span></p>
            </td>
